#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "⚠️ Sensitive Content"
msgstr "⚠️Umxholo obuthathaka"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"This module includes content that may be sensitive. You can check it out by yourself first. This will prepare you well for sharing the content with your teen and others afterwards.\n"
"If you need support, see the “Support Contacts” section in your Library for help."
msgstr ""
"Esi sifundo siquka umxholo ongabanobuthathaka. Ungazikhangelela ngokunokwakho kuqala. Lento ingakulungiselela kakuhle ukwabelana nomxholo nomntwana wakho ofikisayo kunye nabanye emva koko.\n"
"\n"
"Ukuba udinga inkxaso, jonga kwicandelo \"Uqhagamshelwano lwenkxaso\" kwithala leencwadi ukuze uncedakale."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Teens spend lots of time online to learn, have fun, and connect with friends. It can help them grow, but also brings risks.\n"
"As caregivers, we may not know every new app — what matters most is showing interest and building a trusting relationship with our teens."
msgstr ""
"Abantwana abafikisayo bachitha ixesha elininzi ukufunda kwi intanethi, bonwabe, kwaye banxulumane nabahlobo babo. Ingabanceda bakhule, kodwa kananjalo ize nemingcipheko.\n"
"Njengabazali, asidingi ukwazi zonke ii-app ezintsha — eyonanto ebalulekilekileyo kukubonisa umdla kunye nokwakha ubudlelwane bokuthembana kunye nabantwana bethu abafikisayo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "When we listen and guide with care, through small daily moments instead of big once-off conversations, our teens feel safe to share."
msgstr "Xana simamela kwaye sikhokele ngenkathalo, ngemizuzu emincinci yemihla ngemihla endaweni yokuba nengxoxo enkulu enye kuphela, abantwana bethu abafikisayo saziva bekhuselekile ukwabelana."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Why is discussing online safety with your teen important? Click play to find out"
msgstr "Kutheni ukuxoxa ngokhuseleko lwe-intanethi nomntana wakho ofikisayo kubalulekile? Cofa udlala ukufumanisa"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Our teens spend a lot of time online — watching videos, learning, and chatting with friends. The internet can be a great place to learn and connect, but it also comes with risks.\n"
"\n"
"Did you know 1 in 3 young people have been bullied online? Some are even pressured to share private photos or personal information.\n"
"\n"
"We can’t stop everything that happens online. But we can listen, stay calm, and let our teens know they can always come to us. When they feel safe to talk to us, we can help them stay safer."
msgstr ""
"Abantwana bethu abafikisayo bachitha ixesha elininzi kwi -intanethi bebukele iividiyo, befunda kwaye bencokola nabahlobo. I-intanethi ingayindawo elungileyo yokufunda kunye nokunxibelelana, kodwa inako ukuza neengozi.\n"
"\n"
"Ingaba ubuyazi oyi1 kwabayi3 kubantu abatsha bakhe baxhatshazwa kwi-internet? Abanye bade banyanzelwe ngokwabelana ngemifanekiso eyimfihlo okanye ngenkcukacha ezizezakhe.\n"
"\n"
"Asinako ukunqanda yonke into eyenzekayo kwi-intanethi. Kodwa singamamela, kwaye sivumele abantwana bethu abafikisayo bayazi ukuba ngalolonke ixesha bangeza kuthi. Xa beziva bekhuselekile ukuthetha nathi, singabanceda bahlale bekhuselekile."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"When we explore the online world together, we understand our teens better. It shows them that online safety is about trust and support, not control.\n"
"Learning simple steps as a family builds confidence and helps teens make good choices."
msgstr ""
"Xa siphonononga ilizwe le-intaneti kunye, siyabaqonda ngcono abantwana bethu abafikisayo. Ibabonisa ukuba ukhuseleko lwe-intanethi limalunga nokuthemba nenkxaso, hayi ulawulo.\n"
"Ukufunda amanyathelo alula njengo sapho kwakha ukuzithemba kwaye ibancedisa abantwana abafikisayo benze ukhetho olulungileyo."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.media_male_1.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Hear how @data.characters.media_male_1.name learned to talk to his son about online safety"
msgstr "Mamela ukuba @data.characters.media_male_1.name ufunde njani ukuthetha nonyana wakhe ngokhuseleko lwe-intanethi"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"My son was always on his phone, but I did not pay too much attention to it. To be honest, I was busy with other things and happy he was safely at home and not out on the streets. The only time we spoke about his phone was when I was taking it away as punishment for something he did. \n"
"\n"
"The SinovuyoApp helped me realize that the online world is big and can have good and bad sides. We can now talk about what he does online, and we have created rules together to ensure he can enjoy his time online and still stay safe. His phone is no longer a punishment tool but a way we can connect."
msgstr ""
"Unyana wam ebesoloko esefowunini yakhe, kodwa zange ndiyihoye kakhulu lonto. Ukuthetha inyani bendixakekile zezinye izinto kwaye bendivuya kuba ebekhuselekile ekhaya engekho estratweni. Elona xesha sasithetha ngalo ngefowuni yakhe kungexesha ndandiyithatha. njengesohlwayo sento ayenzileyo. \n"
"\n"
"IsinovuyoApp yandinceda ndaqonda ukuba ilizwe le-intanethi likhulu kwaye kungaba namacala amahle kunye namabi. Ngoku singakwazi ukuthetha ngakwenzayo kwi-intanethi, kwaye senze imigaqo kunye ukuqinisekisa ukuba angalonwabela ixesha lakhe kwi-intanethi kwaye ahlale ekhuselekile. Ifowuni yakhe ayisesosixhobo sesohlwayo kodwayindlela esinokunxulumana ngayo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "For teens, the online world feels just as real and important as the offline world."
msgstr "Kubantwana abafikisayo, ilizwe le-intanethi libenza bazive liyinyani kwaye libalulekile njengelizwe elingaphandle kwe-intanethi."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Would you let your teen experience a big new city by themselves? Would you let your teen experience the big online world by themselves?"
msgstr "Ungamvumela umntwana wakho ofikisayo azifumane ekwisixeko esikhulu yedwa? Ungamvumela umntwana wakho ofikisayo azifumane ekwilizwe elikhulu lwe-intanethi eyedwa?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "It’s great that you trust your teen. There are also many risks, so we need to make sure we guide both our boys and girls to stay safe."
msgstr "Kulungile ukumthemba umntwana wakho ofikisayo. Kwaye ikhona neminye imingcipheko emininzi, ngoko siyadinga ukuqinisekisa ukuba bonke abantwana bethu abangamakhwenkwe kunye nabangamanombazana ukuba bahlale bekhuselekile."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Protecting our children shows care. Teen girls and boys also need space to learn and grow. By guiding them, we can balance safety and independence."
msgstr "Ukukhusela abantwana bethu kubonakalisa inkathalo. Abantwana abafikisayo abangamantombi nabangamakhwenkwe nabo badinga ithuba labo lokufunda kunye nokukhula. Ngokubakhokela, singalungalelanisa ukhuseleko kunye nokuzimela."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Parenting online is not easy. By carefully giving freedom while offering guidance, you can help your son or daughter learn while staying safe."
msgstr "Ukuba ngumzali kwi-intanethi akululanga. Ngokunika inkululeko ngenyameko ngelixa unikela ngesikhokelo, unganceda unyanawokho okanye intombi yakho ifunde ngexeshesha ihlala ikhuselekile."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name’s should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Talking about online safety can feel hard. Many caregivers don’t know how to begin. A good start is to show interest in what your teen enjoys online. Let’s see how @data.characters.f1_son_14.name’s mother does this…"
msgstr "Ukuthetha ngokhuseleko lwe-intanethi kungavakala kunzima. Abazali abaninzi abayazi mabaqale njani. Isiqalo esilungileyo kukubonisa umdla kwinto umntana wakho ofikisayo ayonwabelayo kwi-intanethi. Masibone ukuba uyenza njani umama ka @data.characters.f1_son_14.name lento…"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That looks fun! What are you watching?"
msgstr "Oku kubonakala kumnandi! Ubukele ntoni?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "This guy on Instagram gets a million likes on every post! My friends and I make our own videos too."
msgstr "Lomfana uku Instagram ufumana ukuthandwa zizigidi kuzozonke powusti! Abahlobo bam kunye nam senza ezethu ividiyo nathi."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That’s exciting! What do you like about making videos yourself?"
msgstr "Oko kuyonwabisa! Yintoni oyithandayo ngokwenza iividiyo ngokwakho?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "It’s fun to create them with my friends. And people comment on them a lot. I already have 600 followers!"
msgstr "Kuyonwabisa ukuzenza kunye nabahlobo bam. Kwaye abantu bayaphawula kuzo kakhulu. Sendinabalandeli abayi600!"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Wow, that must feel great. It’s exciting when other people like what we do. At the same time, it is important to make sure Instagram is fun and safe for you. Do you have any ideas of how we could do that?"
msgstr "Wowu, kuvakala kukuhle. Kuyonwabisa xa abanye abantu beyithanda into esiyenzayo. Ngaxeshanye, kubalulekile ukuqinisekisa ukuba Instagram uyonwabisa kwaye ukhuselekile kuwe. Ingaba unazo naziphina ezinye iimbono zokuba singayenza njani lonto?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Sometimes I get mean comments, or DMs from people I don’t even know. Maybe I should block them?"
msgstr "Ngamanye amaxesha ndiye ndifumana izimvo ezimbi, okanye DMs ezisuka ebantwini engabazi nokubazi. Mhlawumbi kumele ndibabloke?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes, that’s a really good idea. Do you know how to block people? We can look it up together if you like? I am sure there are other steps too, like making your account private or limiting who can comment."
msgstr "Ewe, ngumbono omhle lowo nyani. Uyayazi kublokwa njani abantu? Singajonga kunye ukuba uyathanda? Ndiqinisekile akhona amanye amanyathelo angamanye, afana nokwenza akhawunti yakho ifihlakale okanye unciphise ngubani onokuphawula."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_mother.role_name. should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes, let’s look it up together, thank you @data.characters.f1_mother.role_name."
msgstr "Ewe, Masijonge kunye, enkosi @data.characters.f1_mother.role_name."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name. should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "I am glad we can talk about this, @data.characters.f1_son_14.name. If something ever feels wrong, remember you can always come to me. We will figure it out together, and you can keep enjoying Instagram safely."
msgstr "Ndiyavuya singathetha ngalento, @data.characters.f1_son_14.name. Ukuba kunento engalunganga, khumbula ungeza kum naninina. Sizakuzama ukuyifumana kunye, kwaye ungaqhubeka wonwabele u Instagram ukhuselekile."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_14.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"We saw how @data.characters.f1_son_14.name and his mother talked openly about his time online.\n"
"Being online can help teens learn, create, and connect — but we also need to guide them to stay safe and use it wisely."
msgstr ""
"Simbonile u @data.characters.f1_son_14.name kunye nomama wakhe bethetha njani kunye ngexesha lakhe lokuba kwi-intanethi.\n"
"Ukuba kwi-intanethi kunganceda abantwana abafikisayo bafunde, benze, kwaye banxulumane — kodwa kukwadinga nathi sibakhokhele ukuhlala bekhuselekile kwaye beyisebenzisa ngobulumko."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "How can being online help our teens?"
msgstr "Ukuba kwi-intanethi kunokubanceda njani abantwana bethu abafikisayo?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Help with learning"
msgstr "Nceda ngokufunda"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Social interaction"
msgstr "Intsebenziswano yoluntu"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Relaxing"
msgstr "Ukuphumla"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Just like adults, teens use phones to connect, relax, and learn. Showing interest builds trust and helps us spot risks early."
msgstr "Njengabantu abadala, abantwana abafikisayo basebenzisa iifowuni zabo ukunxulumana, ukuphola, kunye nokufunda. Ukubonisa umdla kwakha ukuthemba kwaye kunceda sibone umngcipheko kwangethuba."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Sometimes teens run into tricky or even dangerous situations online, and as caregivers it’s not always easy to know what to do.\n"
"\n"
"Let’s look at 5 examples of online warning signs and how we can support our teens."
msgstr ""
"Ngamanye amaxesha abantwana abafikisayo bagaxeleka kwimeko ezikhohlisayo okanye eziyi ngozi kwi-intanethi, kwaye njengabazali akusoloko kulula ukuyazi ukuba mawenze ntoni.\n"
"\n"
"Masijonge imizekelo eyi 5 yeempawu zezilumkiso ze-intanethi kwaye singabaxhasa njani abantwana bethu abafikisayo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "**Warning Sign 1: Lerato is quiet and withdrawn — a change in mood can signal something is wrong.**"
msgstr "**Uphawu lwesilumkiso 1: u-Lerato uthule kwaye urhoxile - ukutshintsha kwemo kubonisa ukuba kukho into engalunganga.**"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "(_thinking_) I am so worried about Lerato. She has been acting differently lately. She seems quiet and keeps to herself."
msgstr "(_ecinga_) Ndikhathazekile kakhulu ngoLerato. Wenza ngokwahlukileyo mva nje. Ubonakala ethule kwaye uzigcinela kuye."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "What could be signs that something is wrong?"
msgstr "Ingaba ziyintoni iimpawu zokuba kukho undonakele?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Being withdrawn or sad"
msgstr "Ukurhonxa okanye ukukhathazeka"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Mood swings or acting out"
msgstr "Ukutshintsha kwemvakalelo okanye ukwenza umdlalo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Hiding phone"
msgstr "Ukufihla ifowuni"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Spending much more time online"
msgstr "Ukhucitha ixesha elininzi kwi-intanethi"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Sharing private images"
msgstr "Ukwabelana ngemifanekiso eyimfihlo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "All of the above"
msgstr "Zonke ezi zingentla"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes, these can be signs that something is wrong. What looks like teen behaviour can sometimes mean your teen feels unsafe. When strangers give attention online, teens may feel excited or special at first. Spending time together and showing interest in who your teen talks to helps you notice changes early."
msgstr "Ewe, ezi ingaba zimpawu zento engalunganga. Into ejongeka ngathi sisimilo somntwana ofikisayo ngamanye amaxesha singathetha ukuba umntwana wakho uziva engakhuselekanga. Xana umntu ongaziwayo enika ingqwalasela kwi intanethi, umntwana wakho ofikisayo angaziva evuya okanye ekhathekile ekuqaleni. Ukuchitha ixesha kunye kwaye ubonakalisa umdla kumntu othetha nomntwana wakho ofikisayo kunceda ukuba uqaphela utshintsho kwangethuba."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f3_daughter_12.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "**Warning Sign 2: @data.characters.f3_daughter_12.name hears about a classmate sharing private photos — hearing such stories is a warning sign to talk with your teen about pressure and safety online.**"
msgstr "**Impawu zesilumkiso 2: U@data.characters.f3_daughter_12.name uve ngomntana afunda naye oye wabelana ngeefoto zabucala - ukuva amabali anjalo zimpawu zesilumkiso ukuba uthethe nomntana wakho ofikisayo kunye nokhuseleko lwe-intanethi**"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.friend_female_5.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Mother, guess what happened at school. My classmate @data.characters.friend_female_5.name shared a sexy picture of herself with her boyfriend to prove that she loves him, and his friends told him to post it online. Now it is everywhere."
msgstr "Mama, qikelela kwenzeke ntoni esikolweni. Umntwana ofunda nam u@data.characters.friend_female_5.name wabelene ngemifanekiso yakhe enomtsalane kwinkwenkwe yakhe uqinisekisa ukuba uyayithanda, kwaye abahlobo bakhe bamxelele ukuba azipowuste kwi-internet. Ngoku ikuyo yonke indawo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "How should the mother respond?"
msgstr "Angaphendula njani umama?"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f3_daughter_12.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Thank @data.characters.f3_daughter_12.name for sharing"
msgstr "Mbulele u@data.characters.f3_daughter_12.name ngokwabelana"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.friend_female_5.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Show empathy for @data.characters.friend_female_5.name"
msgstr "Bonisa uvelwano kwi@data.characters.friend_female_5.name"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Talk about consent and peer pressure"
msgstr "Thetha ngesivumelwano kunye noxinzelelo lwabahlobo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Support reporting and deleting"
msgstr "Xhasa ukuchaza kunye nokucima"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Yes, these are all good responses. By thanking teens and responding supportively, they are more likely to share their own problems. \n"
"Remind them to only share photos with permission, think about consequences, and that bullying and sharing private content is harmful. Support them to take safe steps, like reporting and deleting."
msgstr ""
"Ewe, ezi zimpendulo ezilungileyo zonke. Ngokubulela abantwana abafikisayo kwaye nangokuphendula ngenxaso, banamathuba amaninzi okwabelana nengxaki zabo.\n"
"Bakhumbuze ukuba babelane ngeefotos xa kunemvume kuphela, cinga ngemiphumela, kwaye nango kuhlukunyezwa kwaye ukwabelana nomxholo wabucala kuyingozi. Baxhase bathathe amanyathelo akhuselekileyo, njengokuxela kunye nokucima."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "This form of bullying and pressure can happen to both boys and girls. Boys could respond with anger, while girls may withdraw. Remember, no one should ever be pressured into sharing private photos. If your teen sees or hears about this, remind them to tell a trusted adult right away and not share any of the messages."
msgstr "Olu hlobo lokuxhatshazwa noxinzelelo lunokwenzeka kumakhwenkwe nakumantombazana. Amakhwenkwe angaphendula ngomsinda, ngelixa amantombazana angarhoxa. Khumbula ukuba akukho namnye naninina ekufuneka enyanzelwe ukuba abelane ngeefoto zabucala. Ukuba umntwana wakho ofikisayo ubona okanye uva ngalento, bakhumbuze ukuba baxelele umntu omdala abamthembileyo ngoko nangoko kwaye bangabelani ngayo nawuphi na umyalezo."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_18.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "**Warning Sign 3: @data.characters.f1_son_18.name is being threatened online — fear and threats are warning signs of sexual exploitation or blackmail.** _This happens when someone says they will share private photos or messages to scare or control someone._"
msgstr "**Uphawu lwesilumnkiso 3: U @data.characters.f1_son_18.name uyoyikiswa kwi-intanethi- ukoyika kunye nezoyikiso zimpawu zesilumnkiso zohlukunyezo ngesondo okanye ukuthintelwa.** _Lento yenzeka xana umntu esithi yabelana naye ngefoto eziyimfihlo okanye imiyalezo ukoyikisa okanye ukulawula umntu._"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Send me another picture or I’ll share the last one with your family and friends…"
msgstr "Ndithumelele omnye umfanekiso okanye ndizakwabelana nale yokugqibela nosapho lwakho kunye nabahlobo…"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "(_thinking_): What if my friends and family see those other pictures I sent… I don’t know what to do! Maybe I should talk to my father."
msgstr "(_ecinga_): Kungathini ukuba abahlobo kunye nosapho lwam babone eminye yemifanekiso endayithumelayo... Andiyazi ukuba mandenze ntoni! Mhlawumbi kufanele ndithethe notata wam."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_18.name’s should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "How should @data.characters.f1_son_18.name’s father respond?"
msgstr "Ufanele u@data.characters.f1_son_18.name utata aphendule njani?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Take phone away"
msgstr "Thatha ifowuni"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_18.name, should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "This may feel like protecting @data.characters.f1_son_18.name, but it can push him to hide problems and stop him from telling you next time. Taking the phone does not solve the danger."
msgstr "Oku kungavakala ngokungathi kukhusela u @data.characters.f1_son_18.name kodwa kungenza azifihle ingxaki kwaye kumenze ayeke ukukuxelela kwixesha elizayo. Ukuxutha ifowuni akusombululi ingozi."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_18.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Blame @data.characters.f1_son_18.name"
msgstr "Ukusola u @data.characters.f1_son_18.name"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_18.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Blaming breaks trust. Teens make mistakes, and feeling ashamed can make the situation worse. What matters most is helping @data.characters.f1_son_18.name feel safe and supported."
msgstr "Ukusolana kuqhawula ukuthembana. abantwana abafikisayo bayawenza amaphutha, kwaye ukuziva ulusizi kungasenza isimo sibe ngakumbi. Eyona ingamandla kukunceda u@data.characters.f1_son_18.name azive ekhuselekile kwaye exhaswa."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Support and solve together"
msgstr "Xhasa kwaye nisombulule kunye"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f1_son_18.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes! Stay calm and listen. Tell @data.characters.f1_son_18.name it’s not his fault. Block and report if you can, and plan together what to do if photos are shared. If there’s anyone you both trust, ask them for help."
msgstr "Ewe! Hlala uzolile kwaye umamele. Xelela u@data.characters.f1_son_18.name ayilotyala lakhe. Mvale kwaye uxele ukuba unako, kwaye nicwangcise kunye ukuba nenze nton ngemifanekiso ekwabelwane ngazo. Ukuba ukhona umntu enimthembileyo nobabini, mceleni ukuba anincede."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Can this happen to boys and girls?"
msgstr "Ingaba ingenzeka lento kubantwana abangamakhwenkwe kunye namantombazana?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Both boys and girls can face this kind of online threat, but boys may ask for help less often because they feel ashamed.\n"
"This is a serious and unsafe situation. Remind your teen that it is not their fault and no one deserves to be threatened. Tell them to stop sending pictures, save the messages as proof, and speak to a trusted adult right away."
msgstr ""
"Onke amakhwenkwe kunye namantombazana angajongana nolu hlobo lwesoyikiso kwi-intanethi, kodwa amakhwenkwe anokucela uncedo kancinci kuba baziva benentloni.\n"
"Lento ibalulekile kwaye yimeko engakhuselekanga. Khumbuza umntwana wakho ofikisayo ukuba ayilotyala labo kwaye akukho mntu ufanelwe kukoyikiswa. Baxelele bayeke ukuthumela imifanekiso, gcina imiyalezo njengobungqina, kwaye uthethe nomntu omdala omthembileyo ngoko nangoko."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f2_son_15.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "**Warning Sign 4: @data.characters.f2_son_15.name shared private pictures at school — sharing or showing private or harmful images is a warning sign that teens need clear guidance.**"
msgstr "**Uphawu lwesilumnkiso 4: u @data.characters.f2_son_15.name wabelane ngemifanekiso yabucala esikolweni - ukwabelana okanye ukubonisa imifanekiso eyonzakalisayo zimpawu zesilumkiso ezibonisa ukuba abantwana abafikisayo badinga isikhokhelo esicacileyo.**"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Why is your grandson showing my daughter those pictures at school!"
msgstr "Kutheni umzukulwana wakho ebonisa intombi yam lo mifanekiso esikolweni!"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f2_son_15.name’s should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "How should @data.characters.f2_son_15.name’s grandmother respond?"
msgstr "Kufanele enze njani u @data.characters.f2_son_15.name kumakhulu wakhe ukuphendula?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Deny or defend"
msgstr "Phika okanye khusela"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Denying the problem may feel easier, but it makes the situation worse. It is better to face the issue calmly, so you can understand what happened and give both children the support they need."
msgstr "Ukuphika ingxaki kungavakala kulula, kodwa kwenza isimo sibesibi ngakumbi. Kungcono ukujongana nengxaki uzolile, ukuze uqonde ukuba kwenzeke ntoni kwaye ubanike bobabini abantwana inkxaso abayidingayo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Brush it off"
msgstr "Yisuse"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Saying “boys will be boys” makes harmful behaviour seem normal. This stops children from understanding the real consequences of their actions."
msgstr "Ukuthi \"amakhwenkwe ayakuba ngamakhwenkwe\" kwenza ukuziphatha okuyingozi kubonakale njengokuqhelekileyo. Lento inqanda abantwana ekundeni izimo zokwenyani ngezenzo zabo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Scold child angrily"
msgstr "Ukungxolisa umntana ngmsindo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Getting very angry can shame your teen and close the door to learning. He may only feel fear, without understanding why it was wrong."
msgstr "Ukuba nomsindo kakhulu kungahlaza umntwana wakho ofikisayo kwaye kuvale ingcango zokufunda. Angaziva esoyika, ngaphandle kokuqonda ukuba kutheni kungalunganga."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Pause, listen, and understand"
msgstr "Yima, mamela, kwaye uqonde"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Correct. By staying calm and listening, you help your teen feel safe to talk. This gives you a chance to explain why sharing sexual pictures or videos is harmful and guide him to make better choices in the future."
msgstr "Ichanekile. Ngokuhlala uzolile kwaye umamele, unceda umntwana wakho ofikisayo azive ekhuselekile ukuba athethe. Lento ikunika ithuba lokucacisa ukuba kutheni ukwabelana ngemifanekiso yamanyala kuyingozi, kwaye mkhokele ukuba enze ukhetho olungcono kwixesha elizayo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Are sexual pictures or videos only shared by boys?"
msgstr "Ingaba imifanekiso yezesondo okanye ividiyo zabelwana kuphela ngamakhwenkwe?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Not sure"
msgstr "Andiqinisekanga"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Both boys and girls can be involved in this.\n"
"Teach your teen to respect others and ask before sharing photos or videos. Explain that sharing or watching sexual content can hurt people.\n"
"Remind them it’s illegal to share any nude or sexual images of anyone under 18 — even their own."
msgstr ""
"Onke amakhwenkwe kunye namantombi angabandakanyeka kakhulu kulento.\n"
"Fundisa umntwana wakho ofikisayo ukuba ahloniphe abanye kwaye acele phambi kokwabelana ngeefoto okanye iividiyo. Cacisa ukuba ukwabelana okanye ukubukela umxholo wesondo kunokulimaza abantu.\n"
"Bakhumbuze ukuba akukho mthethweni ukwabelana ngayo nayiphi na imifanekiso enqunu okanye yesondo yakhe nabanina ongaphantsi kweminyaka eyi 18 nokuba yeyakhe."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f2_son_15.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "**Warning Sign 5: @data.characters.f2_son_15.name gets a message from a stranger while showing his grandpa his game. When strangers offer gifts or ask to chat, it’s a warning sign.**"
msgstr "**Impawu zesilumkiso 5: U@data.characters.f2_son_15.name ufumana umyalezo kumntu angamaziyo ngexesha ebonisa utatomkhulu wakhe ngomdlalo wakhe. Xa abantu ongabaziyobenikela ngezipho okanye becela ukuncokola, olo luphawu lwesilumkiso.**"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "I saw your profile. We are at the same school! Let’s chat privately — maybe we can plan how to meet in person. I’ll send you data."
msgstr "Ndiyibonile i profayile yakho. Sisesikolweni esinye! Masincokole bucala- mhlawumbi singacwangcisa ukuba singadibana kanjani iziqu. Ndizokuthumelela u data."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f2_son_15.name’s should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "What would you do if you were @data.characters.f2_son_15.name’s grandfather?"
msgstr "Ubungenza njani ukuba ubungu tatomkhulu ka @data.characters.f2_son_15.name’?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "Ayikho"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ignoring the problem may seem easiest, but it can put teens in danger. Strangers can use personal details from a profile as well as gifts to trick or pressure children."
msgstr "Ukungayihoyi ingxaki kungabonakala njengento elula, kodwa ingabeka abantwana abafikisayo engozini. Abantu abangaziwayo bangasebenzisa inkcukacha zomntu kwiprofayili kunye nezipho ukuqhatha okanye uxinzelelo lwabantwana."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ask questions to understand"
msgstr "Buza imibuzo ukuqonda"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f2_son_15.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes! Ask @data.characters.f2_son_15.name what happened, what information he shared, and how he felt. Then guide him on safe choices like keeping profiles private and not replying to strangers."
msgstr "Ewe! Buza u@data.characters.f2_son_15.name ukuba kwenzeke ntoni, zeziphi ezinkcukacha abelane ngazo, kwaye ebeziva njani. Ngoku mkhokele kukhetho olukhuselekileyo njengoikugcina iprofayili bucla kwaye angaphenduli abantu abangaziwayo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Get angry"
msgstr "Abe nomsindo"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f2_son_15.name should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Getting angry may scare @data.characters.f2_son_15.name and shut down openness. He may hide future problems instead of asking for help. Stay calm so he knows he can trust you."
msgstr "Ukubanomsindo kungoyikisa u@data.characters.f2_son_15.name kwaye avale ukuthethela phandle. Angazifihla iingxaki sexesha elizayo andaweni yokucela uncedo. Hlala uzolile ukuze ayazi ukuba angakuthemba."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Force to show chats"
msgstr "Anyanzele ukubona iincoko"

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.f2_son_15.name, should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Forcing may feel like protecting @data.characters.f2_son_15.name, but it can break trust and lead him to hide things in the future. A better way is to sit together, talk through the risks, and agree on safe solutions as a team."
msgstr "Ukunyanzela kungavakala ngathi ukhusela u@data.characters.f2_son_15.name, kodwa kungophula ukuthemba kwaye kumkhokelele ekufihleni izinto kwixesha elizayo. Indlela engcono kukuhlala kunye, nithethe ngemingcipheko, kwaye nivumelane ngezisombululo ezikhuselekileyo niliqela."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Talk about risks"
msgstr "Thethani ngemingcipheko"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That’s right! Use this as a chance to explain why accepting gifts or sharing personal details (like school or uniform) online is unsafe. Explore together how to block and report strangers, and remind your teen they can always come to you if something feels wrong."
msgstr "Ilungile lonto. Sebenzisa lento njengethuba lokuchaza ukuba kutheni ukwamkela izipho okanye ukwabelana ngenkcukacha zakhe (ezifana nesikolo okanye iyunifomu) kwi-intanethi kuyingozi. Phononongani kunye indlela yokunqanda kwaye nichaze abantu abangaziwayo, kwaye khumbuza umntwana wakho ofikisayo ukuba angeza kuwe ngalo lonke ixesha ukuba kukho into evakala ingalunganga."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Keeping your teen safe online starts with understanding their experiences. Let’s come up with easy ways to get involved in your teen’s world online."
msgstr "Ukugcina abantwana abafikisayo bekhuselekile kwi-intanethi kuqala ngokuqonda amava wabo. Masize nendlela ezilula ukuzibandakanya kwilizwe lwe-intanethi lomntana wakho ofikisayo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"**Here are some examples of shared online moments:**\n"
"\n"
"🖥️ Watch a short video or song together\n"
"💜 Share memes and funny clips\n"
"😊 Ask your teen to teach you something online (like posting a family photo)\n"
"💬 Ask “Did you see anything fun or interesting online today?” \n"
"📓 Help with research or homework online"
msgstr ""
"**Nantsi eminye imizekelo yamaxesha okwabelana kwi-intanethi:**\n"
"\n"
"🖥️ Bukelani ividiyo emfutshane okanye ingoma kunye\n"
"💜 Yabelana ngeememes kunye neeklip ezihlekisayo\n"
"😊 Cela umntana wakho ofikisayo akufundise into kwi-intanethi (njengokufaka ifoto yosapho)\n"
"💬 Buza \"Ingaba ubone nantoni na ehlekisayo okanye eenza umdla kwi-intanethi namhlanje?\"\n"
"📓 Uncedo ngophando okanye umsebenzi wasekhaya kwi-intanethi"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Here are some tips to help you with online safety:"
msgstr "Nazi ezinye iingcebiso ezinokunceda ngokhuseleko kwi-intanethi:"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "TALK AND LISTEN"
msgstr "THETHA KWAYE UMAMELE"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Show interest in what your teen does online and listen without judging.\n"
"\n"
"Talk about safe boundaries, such as only chatting online with people they know in real life. If something goes wrong, stay calm and remind them they can always come to you. Teens share more when they feel safe and trusted."
msgstr ""
"Bonakalisa umdla kwinto eyenziwa ngumntwana wakho ofikisayo kwi intanethi kwaye mamela ngaphandle kokumahlulela.\n"
"\n"
"Thetha malunga nemida, njengo, kuthetha kwi intanethi nabantu ababaziyo ebomini bakhe kuphela. Ukuba kukho into engahambi kakuhle, hlala uzolile kwaye bakhumbuze ukuba bangaza kuwe nanini na. Abantwana abafikisayo babelana ngakumbi xana beziva bekhuselekile kwaye bekuthemba."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Ask your teen what they would do if a friend was in danger online. Remind them it’s okay to involve a trusted adult."
msgstr "Buza umntwana wakho ofikisayo ukuba angenza ntoni xa umhlobo wakhe esengozini kwi-intanethi. Bakhumbuze ukuba kulungile ukubandakanya umntu omdala omthembileyo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "SHARE SAFELY"
msgstr "YABELANA KHUSELEKILEYO"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Remind your teen to think before posting. 💭\n"
"Once something is online, it can spread fast and be hard to delete. \n"
"\n"
"Remind them to always be kind and respectful online, and to ask before sharing anyone’s photo or information — and show this by doing it yourself. Private or sexual pictures should never be shared."
msgstr ""
"Khumbuza umntwana wakho ofikisayo ukuba bacinge ngaphambi kokuba baxhome izinto kwi intanethi. 💭 \n"
"Xana into ikwi intanethi inganwenwa ngokukhawuleza kwaye kubenzima ukuyisusa.\n"
"\n"
"Bakhumbuze ukuba kufuneka basoloko benobubele kwaye behlonipha kwi intanethi, kwaye bacele ngaphambi kokuba babelane nge foto okanye inkcukacha zabanye abantu — kwaye bonakalisa ngokuyenza wena. Imifanekiso yangasese okanye yezesondo akufunekanga wabelane ngazo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Encourage your teen to remind friends to stay safe too — friends can help friends make good choices."
msgstr "Khuthaza umntwana wakho ofikisayo ukuba akahumbuze abahlobo bakhe ukuba bahlale bekhuselekile - abahlobo banganceda abahlobo benze izigqibo ezilungileyo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "NOTICE AND RESPOND"
msgstr "QAPHELA KWAYE PHENDULE"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Watch for warning signs, like mood changes, hiding phone, sudden extra time online. This can happen when someone online asks for photos, secrets, or offers gifts like money or airtime.\n"
"\n"
"If something unsafe happens, don’t blame or punish your teen. Stay calm and help them block the person, report the problem, and delete sensitive photos or messages they shared.\n"
"\n"
"If your teen has hurt others online, stay calm. Help them learn and do better — without shame or anger."
msgstr ""
"Bukela impawu zesilumnkiso, utshintsho lwesimo, ukufihla i fowuni, ixesha elikhawulezileyo elongezelelweyo lwe intanethi. Lento ingenzeka xana umntu ecela amafoto, imfihlo, okanye izipho ezinjenge mali okanye i airtime.\n"
"\n"
"Ukuba kwenzeka into engakhuselekanga, sukubeka ityala okanye wohlwaye umntwana wakho ofikisayo. Hlala uzololile kwaye ubancede uku bloka lomntu, xela ingxaki, kwaye ususe amafoto amanyukunyezi okanye imiyalezo abayothumeleyo.\n"
"\n"
"Ukuba umntwana wakho ofikisayo wonzakalise abanye kwi intanethi, hlala uzolile. Bancede bafunde kwaye benze ngcono _ ngaphandle kwexhala okanye umsindo."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"**Deleting** means removing content (like a photo or message).\n"
"**Reporting** means telling the app about the problem (for example on Facebook or TikTok).\n"
"\n"
"Remind your teen they can always ask for help if something feels wrong. They can ask you, a teacher, another trusted adult, or contact Childline (call 116)."
msgstr ""
"**Ukucima** kuthetha ukususa umxholo (njengamafoto okanye imiyalezo).\n"
"**Ukubika** kuthetha ukuxelela i app malunga nengxaki (umzekelo kuFacebook okanye kuTikTok).\n"
"\n"
"Khumbuza umntwana wakho ofikisayo ukuba bangalufuna uncedo nanini na ukuba kukho into abayiva ingalunganga. Bangacela wena, utitshala, nomnye umntu omdala othembakeleyo, okanye baqhagamshelane no Childline (call 116)."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "PROTECT YOUR PRIVACY"
msgstr "KHUSELA UBUMFIHLO BAKHO"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Set accounts to private, turn off location sharing, and use strong passwords. Remind your teen not to share their full name, phone number, home address, school name, or photos in school uniform. Explore together how to block and report anyone who makes them feel uncomfortable."
msgstr "Misela i-akhawunti bucala. Cima ukwabelana ngendawo okuyo, kwaye usebenzise ipasswords eqinileyo. Khumbuza abantwana bakho abafikisayo ukuba bangabelani ngamagama wabo apheleleyo, ngenombolo zefowuni yabo, nedilesi yekhaya lakhe, negama lesikolo, okanye ifoto benxibe impahla zesikolo. Khangelani kunye indlela yokubhloka okanye uxele nabanina owenza bazive bengakhululekanga."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "More tips"
msgstr "Ezinye iingcebiso"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Parental controls and online safety are confusing! Talk with other caregivers, research ways to keep your child safe, and talk about it together."
msgstr "Ulawulo lobuzali kunye nokhuseleko kwi intanetho kuyaxaka! Thetha nabanye abanakekeli, phanda iindlela zokugcina umntwana wakho ekhuselekile, kwaye thethani ngayo kunye."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"This week’s activity is to make an Online Family Agreement with your teen. \n"
"\n"
"When you create rules together, teens feel part of the team — not controlled — and are more likely to follow them."
msgstr ""
"Umsebenzi waleveki kukwenza isivumelwano sosapho kwi-intanethi kunye nomntwana wakho ofikisayo.\n"
"\n"
"Xa niyila imigaqokunye, abantwana abafikisayo baziva beyinxalenye yeqela - hayi ukulawulwa- kwaye kunokwenzeka ukuba bayilandele."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"**Sit with your teen and make 5 rules for safe and fun online time.\n"
"Stick them on the wall when you’re done!**\n"
"👩‍👩‍👦 When both caregivers join in, your teen sees that everyone helps keep the family safe ❤️.\n"
"\n"
"**Sample Online Family Agreement**\n"
"\n"
"Our family agrees to these rules for safe and fun online time:\n"
"🔑 Keep accounts private\n"
"🚩 Do not share school, address, or phone number\n"
"✅ Ask permission before sharing photos of others\n"
"⏰ No phones during meals or at bedtime\n"
"☀️ Be kind and respectful to others online\n"
"😃 Share one positive or funny post or video with the family each week\n"
"💛 Teens: I will talk to an adult if anything feels wrong or uncomfortable online\n"
"✨ Caregivers: I will listen and support my teens without judging or blaming\n"
"\n"
"Signed by:\n"
"🔶 Parent / Caregiver __________\n"
"🔷 Teen __________"
msgstr ""
"**Hlala nomntwana wakho ofikisayo kwaye wenze imithetho emi- 5 yokhuseleko kunye nexesha elimnandi kwi-intanethi. \n"
"Zincamathelise edongeni xa nigqibile!**\n"
"👩‍👩‍👦 Xa bobabini umama notata bengenelela, umntwana wakho ofikisayo uyabona ukuba wonke umntu uyancedisa ukugcina usapho lukhuselekile ❤️.\n"
"\n"
"**Isampuli yesivumelwano sosapho kwi-intanethi**\n"
"\n"
"Usapho lwethu luyavumelana nalemithetho ngexesha elikhuselekileyo nelo lonwabo kwi-intanethi:\n"
"🔑 Gcina ii-akhawunti ziyimfihlo\n"
"🚩 Musa ukwabelana ngesikolo, idilesi okanye inombolo yefowuni\n"
"✅ Cela imvume phambi kokuba wabelane ngemifanekiso yabanye\n"
"⏰ Azivumelekanga iifowuni ngexesha lesidlo okanye elokulala\n"
"☀️ Yiba nobubele kunye netlonipho kwabanye kwi-intanethi\n"
"😃 Yabelana ngento ibenye elungileyo, okanye uxhome okuhlekisayo okanye ividiyo kunye nosapho lwakho veki nganye\n"
"💛 Abantwana abafikisayo: Ndizakuthetha nomntu omdala ukuba kukho into engalunganga okanye engakhululekanga kwi-intanethi\n"
"✨ Abazali: Ndizakubamamela kwaye ndibaxhase abantwana bam abafikisayo ngaphandle ngokugxeka okanye ukusola\n"
"\n"
"Ityikitywe ngu:\n"
"🔶 Umzali / umkhathaleli __________\n"
"🔷 Umntwana ofikisayo __________"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Can you create and try out your Online Family Agreement this week?"
msgstr "Ingaba ungenza okanye uzame isivumelwano sosapho esikwi-intanethi kuleveki?"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ewe"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Making the agreement together shows your teen that online safety is about teamwork. You can always change or update your agreement later as well."
msgstr "Ukwenza isivumelwano kunye kubonisa umtwana wakho ofikisayo ukuba ukukhuseleko lwe-intanethi lungetsebenziswano. Unakho ukutshintsa ngalolonke ixesha or uhlaziye nesivumelwano kamva."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "I think so"
msgstr "Ndicinga njalo"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Give it a try. Involving your teen in choosing the rules helps them feel respected and makes it more likely they will follow them. You can start with just one rule and add more later."
msgstr "Yizame. Ukubandakanya umntwana wakho ofikisayo ekukhetheni imithetho kuyabanceda bazive behloniphekile kwaye ibenze lonto bayilandele ngakumbi. Ungaqala nje ngomthetho omnye kwaye wongeze eminye mva."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Hayi"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "That’s okay. You can start small. Even agreeing on just one rule together is a good first step. You can always add more ideas later on."
msgstr "Intle lonto. Ungaqala kancinci. Kwanokuvumelana nje ngomgaqo omnye kunye linyathelo elihle lokuqala. Usenokwangeza naninina eminye imibono mva."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"Online risks can look different for boys and girls. They may hide or act out in different ways. When we blame or punish, they stop sharing — and the risk grows.\n"
"\n"
"You don’t need to know everything. The best way to keep your teen safe is to build trust, stay calm, and let them know they can always come to you for help."
msgstr ""
"Imingcipheko ye-Intanethi ingajongeka ngendlela eyahlukileyo kamakhwenkwe namantombazana. Banokuzifihla okanye benze ngendlela ezahlukeneyo. Xa sigxeka okanye sisohlwaya bayayeka ukwabelana - kwaye umngcipheko uyakhula.\n"
"\n"
"Akunyanzelekanga ukuba wazi yonke into. Indlela engcono kugcina abantwana bakho abafikisayo bekhuselekile kukwakha ukuthembana, uhlale uzolile, kwaye bayeke bayazi ukuba bangeza kuwe bafumane uncedo ngalolonke ixesha."

#. type=data_list
#. The string @data.characters.media_daughter_9.name’s should not be translated.
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Hear how @data.characters.media_daughter_9.name’s mother helped her keep safe online"
msgstr "Makhe sibone ukuba umama ka @data.characters.media_daughter_9.name umnceda njani ukuba ahlale ekhuselekile kwi-intanethi"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Someone took my photo and put it on a naked body in a video. I freaked out and didn’t want to tell anyone, because I thought my parents would just take my phone away. But when my mom saw I was upset and asked, she stayed calm. We reported it together and made a plan on what to do next. I told my friends it was a fake, and my family did the same. I felt like everyone was on my side. Now I know I don't have to deal with things like this by myself."
msgstr "Omnye umntu uthathe ifoto yam wayibeka kumzimba ohambaze kwividiyo. Ndoyike kakhulu kwaye andifunanga kuxelela nabani na kuba ndicinga ukuba abazali bam bazokuvele boxuthe ifowuni yam. Kodwa xa umama wam endibona ukuba ndikhathazekile wabuza, enomoya ophantsi. Siye sayirepota kunye kwaye senza icebo lokuba sizokwenza njani kwixesha elizayo. Ndiye ndaxelela abahlobo bam ukuba ibingeyonyani nabazali bam benza into enye. Ndive ukuba wonke umntu ungakwicala lam. Ngoku ndiyayazi ukuba akunyazelekanga ndijongane nezinto ezifana nezi ndindedwa."

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Well done for taking time for yourself today. 🎉"
msgstr "Wenze kakuhle ngokuthatha ixesha lesiqu sakho namhlanje. 🎉"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid "Here is a short video to help you slow down before you go"
msgstr "Nali ushicilelo olufutshane elizokunceda wehlise ngaphambi kokuba uhambe"

#. type=data_list
msgctxt "data_list"
msgid ""
"When everything feels like it is falling apart And you can't help but raise your voice When all the frustrations are beginning to start Remember that you have a choice\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more\n"
"\n"
"You can take pause, you can count to 10 Play a game or do something fun You can phone a friend, someone to confide in Remember you're not the only one\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more\n"
"\n"
"Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Remember all we have to be grateful for Let's slow down Take a few deep breaths Because I really couldn't love you more Because I really couldn't love you more"
msgstr ""
"Xa yonke into ivakala ingathi iyamoshakala Kwaye awukwazi ukuzinceda uvele unyuse ilizwi Xa zonke iinzingo ziqala Khumbula ukuba ungenza ngakumbi\n"
"\n"
"Makhe sime kancinci Tsala umoya kancinci Khumbula konke esino kubulela ngako Makhe sehlise kancinci Tsala umoya kancinci Kuba andinakuthanda ngakumbi\n"
"\n"
"Yima, ungabala uyokutsho ku 10 Dlala umdlalo okanye wenze into emnandi Ungafowunela umhlobo, umntu onokumchazela ingxaki Khumbula ayinguwe wedwa\n"
"\n"
"Makhe sime kancinci Tsala umoya kancinci Khumbula konke esino kubulela ngako Makhe sime Tsala umoya kancinci Kuba bendingenokuthanda ngakumbi \n"
"\n"
"Makhe sime kancinci Tsalaa umoya Khumbula konke esino kubulela ngako Makhe sime Tsalaa umoya kancinci Kuba bendingenokuthanda ngakumbi Kuba bendingenokuthanda ngakumbi"

